# Implementation Plan - 2FA Authentication & Registration OTP Verification

This plan outlines the implementation of **2FA Authentication (Email & WhatsApp Dual Delivery)** and the **Registration Form OTP Verification Upgrade**.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **2FA Master Toggle in Settings:** A new toggle `Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)` will be added to the Security Settings page for Patients, Doctors, and Admins (SuperAdmin exempted).
> - **Simultaneous Dual Channel 2FA Delivery:** If 2FA is enabled and a user has **both** Email and WhatsApp on file, the system will generate **ONE** OTP code and send it to **BOTH** channels simultaneously.
> - **Registration Dual Channel OTP Verification:** On the registration page, each channel (Email, WhatsApp) has an inline `Send OTP` + `Verify` flow. Duplicate checks trigger immediately when `Send OTP` is clicked. `Create Account` requires at least 1 verified channel.

