### 2. Application Layer DTOs & Services (.NET Core)

#### [MODIFY] [AuthDTOs.cs](file:///d:/shivam/doctor-appointment-system/DoctorAppointmentSystem/DoctorAppointmentSystem/Application/DTOs/AuthDTOs.cs)
- Add `VerifyTwoFactorDto`: `{ UserId / TargetIdentifier, OtpCode }`.
