#### [MODIFY] [AuthService.cs](file:///d:/shivam/doctor-appointment-system/DoctorAppointmentSystem/DoctorAppointmentSystem/Application/Services/AuthService.cs)
- **Login Flow Update:**
  1. Verify password.
  2. If `user.IsTwoFactorEnabled` is `true` (and not SuperAdmin):
     - Generate single 6-digit 2FA OTP code.
     - Store in Redis cache (`2fa_otp:{userId}`).
     - If user has verified Email $\rightarrow$ Enqueue Email OTP.
     - If user has verified WhatsApp $\rightarrow$ Dispatch WhatsApp OTP.
     - Return `{ requiresTwoFactor = true, userId = user.UserId, sentTo = ["Email", "WhatsApp"] }`.
- Implement `VerifyTwoFactorAsync`: Verify 2FA OTP code and generate JWT token upon success.

#### [MODIFY] [UserService.cs](file:///d:/shivam/doctor-appointment-system/DoctorAppointmentSystem/DoctorAppointmentSystem/Application/Services/UserService.cs)
- Implement `ToggleTwoFactorAsync(Guid userId, bool enabled)` to update `user.IsTwoFactorEnabled`.

